/workspace/src/data/DataStore.ts:1091
/workspace/src/data/DataStore.ts:1092
/workspace/src/data/DataStore.ts:1093
```

Both blocks are byte-identical (verified with `sed -n '881,888p' … | cat -A` and
`sed -n '1087,1094p' … | cat -A`), 4-space indented, `*` continuation aligned at column 6.
No other file (`index.d.ts`, `extension-src/`, `ssr/`, `test/*.html`, `theme/`) contains this

